wgf-autopilot 1
# Wardens' playthrough with screenshots (wgf autopilot shots.autopilot --web): the title once its files have loaded, Play, a run to the right, a
# pause and back, then the warden turning to meet the enemies (a step one way, then the
# other, around the four directions) as her sword works through them, to the first level's
# cards (the second picked), and the run going on.
seed 1
at 1 wait wardens.ready == 1
at 10 expect wardens.state == 1
at 20 key tap enter
at 22 expect wardens.state == 2
at 30 expect wardens.alive >= 1
at 31 screenshot play
at 40 key down d
at 100 key up d
at 101 expect wardens.x > 4.5
at 101 expect wardens.x < 5.5
at 120 key tap escape
at 122 expect wardens.state == 3
at 140 key tap escape
at 142 expect wardens.state == 2
at 160 key down d
at 210 key up d
at 211 key down a
at 214 key up a
at 274 key down w
at 324 key up w
at 325 key down s
at 328 key up s
at 388 key down a
at 438 key up a
at 439 key down d
at 442 key up d
at 502 key down s
at 552 key up s
at 553 key down w
at 556 key up w
at 616 key down d
at 666 key up d
at 667 key down a
at 670 key up a
at 730 key down w
at 780 key up w
at 781 key down s
at 784 key up s
at 844 key down a
at 894 key up a
at 895 key down d
at 898 key up d
at 958 key down s
at 1008 key up s
at 1009 key down w
at 1012 key up w
at 1100 wait wardens.state == 4
at 1101 expect wardens.level == 2
at 1101 expect wardens.kills >= 5
at 1102 screenshot cards
at 1110 key tap right
at 1120 key tap enter
at 1122 expect wardens.state == 2
at 1180 screenshot after-card
at 1300 expect wardens.hp > 0
at 1300 end
